Logistics by Gurtam, the developer of Wialon satellite tracking system, is created specifically for distribution companies and delivery services. The new order management application is designed to use with Logistics web-service on the part of couriers and drivers.  

With Logistics Mobile installed your smartphone becomes the point where the office encounters the field. 

Getting started is easy: create a driver with phone number and mobile key in Wialon system, assign him to a unit and authorize in the app using the mobile number. 

Try now to automate order management with the advanced functions: 
- view the list of orders and detailed information on each;
- track and evaluate delivery progress;
- observe orders and estimated routes on the map;
- receive push-notifications on relevant events regarding orders, routes, and delivery process;
- make a detailed route to an order using external navigational applications;
- assign status to each order (confirmed/rejected), add comments and photos; 
- chat with operators to notify them about any circumstances considering delivery;
- confirm delivery by attaching a photo with customer signature to an order with data on customer name, delivery time and date indicated on a photo;
- enjoy tablet-optimized interface to simultaneously view orders in tables and on the map;
- option to use your smartphone as a tracker. 

We offer advanced courier assistant on every stage of delivery. 

Note: 
If you have any questions, please feel free to contact our technical support team at support@gurtam.com

Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.

MyRoute-app Mobile is the ideal companion for your trips. You can use the app to add photos and favorite locations, making your trip even more fun. The app can now also be used as a simple, free navigation system by following the line of your route!

Features in MyRoute-app Mobile:
* Drive your favorite routes;
* Make tracks (breadcrumbs) while driving;
* Add photos to your trip;
* Save places as favorites;
* Choose from choice map styles;
* Create routes in the cloud;
* Find the highest quality routes in the online route library;

Looking for the real navigation app from MyRoute-app? Then search for "MyRoute-app Navigation" in the App Store.

Logistics Local by Gurtam is a service specially designed for delivery, courier and distribution companies. The new app for order management is intended for use with Logistics web-application now available for Wialon Local users.

With Logistics Local Mobile on your smartphone, you get your interaction with the office up to a new level.

How do you get started? Just a create a driver in Wialon Local, add your phone number and a mobile key, assign the driver to a vehicle, launch the mobile app and authorize with the phone number! 
Use the app to automate delivery process with the advanced features:
- easily accessible list of orders with detailed information on each; 
- delivery progress evaluation in real-time;
- detailed map to view orders and estimated route; 
- push-notification on orders, routes, and delivery progress to be immediately alerted;
- option to generate routes using external navigational applications; 
- order progress statuses (confirmed/rejected), comments and photos for each order; 
- handy chat to notify operators on any events on the way; 
- delivery confirmation with customer digital signature with data on customer name, delivery time and date indicated on a photo;
- tracker software functionality embedded into the app;
- optimization for tablets to view orders in tables and on the map simultaneously.

We offer advanced courier assistant on every stage of delivery.

Note: 
If you have any questions, please feel free to contact our technical support team at support@gurtam.com

